  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Giving Tuesday help me get into school!</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Hope School In Santa Luzia do Itanhy, Brazil, provides an immersive art and technology-centered education to children starting from daycare and extending through to 5th grade. These children come from extremely vulnerable environments where the average income per person is under $30.00 USD per month. While we have raised 83% of our goal, we need your help to ensure that the project is finished and that the children can receive the education they deserve.</narrative>
  </description>
